# Insights Hub Sales API - example calls
#
# Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
# start the API (cd backend; uvicorn app.main:app --reload),
# then click "Send Request" above any request.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check -> {"status": "ok"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List sales: September 2026 non-returns, 1 row per page -> total 298
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?is_return=false&date_from=2026-09-01&date_to=2026-09-30&page_size=1

### Sales summary grouped by region -> 4 groups (East, North, South, West)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/summary?group_by=region

### Regions -> ["East", "North", "South", "West"]
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions

### Brands -> 8 brands
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands

### SKUs -> 23 SKUs with sku_code, sku_name, brand
GET {{baseUrl}}/skus

### Distributors -> 24 distributors with dist_code, distributor_name, region, state
GET {{baseUrl}}/distributors


# ---------- extra examples ----------

### Summary with no filters -> row_count 5418, net_value 60984552.24
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/summary

### Summary for one brand in one month -> net_value 462440.22
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/summary?brand=Navratna&date_from=2025-12-01&date_to=2025-12-31

### Invalid input -> 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?page_size=500

### Unknown sku_code -> 404 SKU_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?sku_code=NOPE-1
